      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand the Juggernaut playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
        "",
        "&fMore armor, health and healing received; lower movement speed and attack damage. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
